     4962       end.
     4963       run clntattr-value in this-procedure ( input 'орг':U, input v-cntxt-host-code-obj, input 'egrip-num':U , output v-host-egrip-num , output v-par-type).
     4964       tt-rep1.firm-egrip =  v-host-egrip-num.
